window.products.push({"id":392008,"name":"RNK Shops Toile Waste Basket - Single Sided (White) (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SjZqgss6L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turn your trash can into a charming piece of decor with one of our waste baskets! These custom wastebaskets are the perfect way to add a splash of color and personality to any office, home decor, bathroom, and more! Coordinate it with the decor you already have in your home, or design it with bold patterns so that it may serve as an accent piece in your home!These trash baskets are made of sturdy plastic in a beautiful oval shape that is tapered from the top to the bottom. Each waste paper basket can hold 1.75 gallons, or 7 quarts, and measures approximately 7 by 9 by 11 inches. At this slim size, they are ideal for sliding underneath desks, and also make for wonderful bathroom wastebaskets, as they can easily fit into tighter spaces.You can choose to purchase these decorative wastebaskets in either a white or a black color that will show on the base and the upper rim. Your customization is printed on a high-gloss, fine-quality vinyl adhesive, and you can choose to either have this adhesive applied to one side only or to both sides. As such, this plastic wastebasket can be single-sided or double-sided, depending on your creative vision. Your customization is printed using durable inks, making the design waterproof and resistant to fading over time.Design Shown: Toile (#53916)Features:==================================== * Made from a durable plastic * Oval shape, tapered from top to bottom * Holds 7 quarts or 1.75 gallons * Approximately 7\" X 9\" X 11\" * Two colors available: white and black * Customization can be single-sided or double-sided * Durable inks makes design waterproof and resistant to fading * Made for you in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SjZqgss6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B00ZSAT3X2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZSAT3X2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZSAT3X2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
