window.products.push({"id":392106,"name":"JULGIRL Oversized Blanket Hoodie for Kids Animal Sherpa Fleece Wearable Blanket Sweatshirt with Pocket Novelty Hoodies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SvbgsJUcL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Fleece Imported Pull On closure Machine Wash ✿ Material: This Kids Blanket Sweatshirt is made of soft high quality polyester fleece and fluffy polyester lamb fleece, which is soft to the touch and keeps kids warm from head to toe. Since we ship the goods to Amazon warehouse by sea, we use vacuum packing to avoid moisture. Please don't mind when you receive the item, just wash and dry it back to its original shape with a clear print. ✿ Unique Design: This kids wearable blanket hoodie features a hood, two cute front pockets and sleeves. Two front pockets hold your child's snacks, small toys and more. The new design of the cute animal hood is full of childlike fun and keeps the child's head warm. Beautiful cuffs keep sleeves clean and hands warm, and the wide fit allows your child's limbs to move freely without any restrictions, perfect for indoor or outdoor activities. ✿ Occasion: This cute hooded sweater is not only suitable for kids to study at home, play, watch TV, lie on the sofa, keep warm and comfortable while playing games, but also suitable for kids to go out for walks, hikes, outings, going to the playground, mountain climbing, picnics , outdoor barbecue and other outdoor activities. All in all, this cute blanket sweater will keep your kids warm in the cold spring, fall and winter! ✿ Size: There are two sizes of the same hoodie, but the length of the sweater is different, the shorter one is more convenient for children to play at home; the longer one is warmer and more suitable for children to sleep on the sofa at home, sit and do homework. Size S----length is 60 cm; size M----length is 75. According to the specific needs of the child, choose a sweater that is more suitable for the length of the child. ✿ Gift and Wash: This comfy hoodie is a great gift for all your kids, grandchildren, nieces or nephews during winter holidays -----Cosplay, Halloween, Christmas, Birthday, New Years, Thanksgiving, Children's Day Sweet gift, they will love it! The sweatshirt is vacuum packed and may be a little wrinkled when opened, please shake or pat to fluff it up. It is recommended to wash once before putting on your child, either machine wash in cold water or by hand, and tumble dry at low temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SvbgsJUcL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JULGIRL","source_asin":"B0B41YFWTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B41YFWTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B41YFWTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":392107,"name":"Papery Pop Invitations with Envelopes (15 Count) - Bridal Shower Invitations, Wedding Shower Invitations, Bachelorette Party Invitations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E9C4TwioL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These high quality invitations are printed on heavyweight matte card stock paper and have mailing envelopes made out of superior paper. The invitations are post card style (non-folding) and come in an elegant design that your guests will absolutely love. There are 15 cards in total with 15 accompanying white envelopes all measuring 5×7 inches (A7 format). The invitations are single-sided and can be written on in either pencil or pen without smearing. Not only do they come in rich vibrant colors but they are thick, making them more durable! Copyrighted design registered by Papery Pop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E9C4TwioL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Papery Pop","source_asin":"B06XZHRXJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XZHRXJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XZHRXJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
