window.products.push({"id":392118,"name":"Colonial Candle Apple Allspice Scented Tin Candle, Classic Collection, 5 oz - Up to 36 Hours Burn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jeD-Vk8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The newest evolution of Colonial Classics, our premium fragrance levels poured into illustrative gift tins make for a perfect giftable piece this season.Apple Allspice is the perfect mix of apple and all things spice. Welcome your favorite fresh autumn scents to your home this season. The perfect addition to your favorite harvest traditions, this candle will keep a smile on your face. The decorative label and cute tin make this a perfect addition to a hostess gift or thank you present.A fall favorite inspired by the fruits and spices of the season Apple Allspice is a harvest classic that everyone loves! With notes of apple and fall fruits this fragrance has refreshing aromas that awaken your senses and brighten your home. Juicy crisp apple is blended with warm cinnamon, allspice and vanilla for an aroma to bring back your favorite fall memories. This delicious fragrance is poured into a 5 ounce tin, making this candle the perfect addition to any gift this harvest season. A high fragrance load ensures a premium fragrance experience with every burn, even in a small package! Wrapped in a beautiful illustrative label, this small tin candle adds a touch of fun and color to your harvest décor!The Colonial Candle Harvest and Holiday Gift Tin Collection celebrates the holiday season with classic Colonial Candle fragrances. Poured into a 5oz tin, this collection is the perfect addition to any gift. Enjoy the same fragrance power as the Colonial Candles Classic in just a small dose. Nothing says holiday season like Colonial Candles Harvest and Holiday!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jeD-Vk8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Colonial Candle","source_asin":"B09RWXMFXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RWXMFXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RWXMFXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
