window.products.push({"id":392123,"name":"THE PERFECT XXL Wire Basket, Set of 3 Pantry Baskets | Metal Baskets, Wire Baskets, Organization Baskets | Black Wire Basket, Large Wire Basket,Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vGUJnJKUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A UNIQUE TRIO: You’ve probably seen many wire baskets for organizing today. But these three baskets have a unique trio of benefits to make storage easier! Because it’s the only set that is Extra Large, Stackable AND Easy Access. So you can have pantry organization, without the ‘finding-things’ struggle. XXL STORAGE ORGANIZATION: Your set comes with 3x Metal Storage Baskets, 16x12” and 5.25” Deep. They’re the largest basket set you’ve found on your search and perfect for potatoes and onions, fruits and vegetables, can organizer, bathroom farmhouse towel holder, toilet paper basket or kids toy basket. CARRY AND STACK! Notice the handles on these organizing baskets, they’re for portability. But when you flip them down they become a platform to stack the next wire storage basket on top! So you can stack your baskets for pantry storage from a shelf or add another set and stack from the floor! FREEZER SAFE: These wire storage baskets are rust-proof and made from iron, powder coated in black, so they’re durable for use as freezer baskets. The 12” WIDE opening in front makes it easy to retrieve food without moving your freezer bins around, and the handy Chalkboard lets you label what’s inside! MODERN OR FARMHOUSE? Because our baskets for pantry storage are a black wire basket they fit into any contemporary home decor. But of course, the wire-style is ideal for farmhouse kitchen decor or as a decorative basket for country bathroom decor or office. Pop them in your home today and see!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vGUJnJKUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jumiju","source_asin":"B08CS2HPDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CS2HPDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CS2HPDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
