window.products.push({"id":392277,"name":"AURAA Comfort 100% Organic Cotton Washed Percale Sheet Set - King Sheets - 4 Piece Sheet Set, 16 Inch DEEP Pocket, GOTS Certified - Sycamore Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RQeNtYqqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Imported Material and Set includes - 100% ORGANIC COTTON BEDDING, King Set includes a 108\" x 108\" inch flat Sheet, 78\" x 80\" + 16\" inch fitted Sheet and 2 Standard 21\" x 40\". Crisp and cool to the touch, our lightweight organic sheets are great for hot summer nights. Our sheet are perfect in Fitting for ease of use and stays put all night. The deep pocket fits tall and low profile mattresses. The finest Quality adds a classy finish to the set. Soft and Smooth Sheet-Made from pure organic fibers, our sheets pass numerous quality checks to ensure they're free from harmful things for you and the planet. This eco-friendly collection has a breathable percale weave that offers comfort all year-around.Our natural organic cotton sheets are extra durable.Our Sheets are of softest construction with extra-long staple organic cotton fiber.We have made sure that all our sheets are absolutely flawless and smooth with our stringent quality checks Luxury Organic sheets -Organic beddings are more comfortable,breathable as they tendency to absorb moisture from our bodies better than synthetic products which gives a peaceful night of sleep.The cotton used for making organic bed sheets is harvested in a natural way which does not cause harm to you and further to environment.This also helps the mattress to dry faster and avoids mould.The production of these sheets is done sustainably,thus making sure the impact on the environment is minimal. Certification - These 100% organic cotton bed sheets set are GOTS Certified (Global Organic Textile Standard) and OEKO TEX Standard 100 assures a bedding that's nontoxic & chemical-free for your family.GOTS ensures the organic status of textiles from the harvesting of the raw materials through environmentally and socially responsible in order to provide credible assurances to the consumer. The standard covers the from processing to packaging and based on that certified organic natural fibres. Eco-Friendly Packagaing- Our product Arrives skillfully packaged in a Self-Fabric Organic reusable tote bag for Beautiful Gifting and easy storage. We have made our packaging reusable so that it is easy on the environment. We are also worried about the green factor of our surrounding and hence our packaging is recyclable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RQeNtYqqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RENAURAA","source_asin":"B07MC39VWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MC39VWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MC39VWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
