window.products.push({"id":392487,"name":"UDEAR Kids Desk and Chair Set,Height Adjustable, Tiltable Table Top,Kids School Study Desk with Storage,Reading and Learning Desk with Drawer for Boys","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LXhiepMIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still looking for a suitable children's learning table and chair for your children? Our products should meet your needs.Our children's table and chair design has the characteristics of humanization and many functions, which is very suitable for children's learning and leisure use. It can adjust the height of the table according to the growing height of the child. It is ergonomic and can make the child sit comfortably and have the correct sitting posture, which is very important to keep healthy. It has a rotatable reading Frame that can fix books, provide better visual effects and protect eyes from distance, and reduce visual damage. The embedded drawer under the desk, which can put books, pens and sundries, provides more storage space for children and reduces the occurrence of desktop chaos. In addition, this children's table and chair is made of high quality materials and exquisite workmanship, safe and environmental protection, no smell, strong and stable, long service life, can accompany the children for a long time.Specifications:-Color:Grey-Material:Iron+Plastic+ MDF Material-Size:Desk Size:70*55*53-78cm-Weight:17.5KgPackage Contents:1*Desk Chair Set1*Reading Frame1*User ManualNotes: 1.Due to the problem of manual measurement, there may be some size difference in the product.2.When using children's desks and chairs, place them on a flat floor to prevent shaking.3.If you encounter any problems related to the product, you can contact us in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LXhiepMIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UDEAR","source_asin":"B08M958HYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M958HYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M958HYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":392488,"name":"Sun Bulb 51730 Better GRO Octagon Cedar Basket, 10\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QCKWtBZtL._AC_.jpg","description":"This 10-inch octagonal slatted cedar wood basket makes a great planter for most orchids with or without potting medium. It's hand crafted for quality and strength with a unique octagon shape. This attractive natural wood basket has commonly been called a Vanda basket, as it works particularly well with the Vanda type orchid. It can be used for a variety of other plants such as ferns and bromeliads as it provides excellent drainage. Coconut fiber and sphagnum moss make a good liner for use with plants potted in potting soil. Mesh onion/vegetable sacks also work great. Galvanized wire eyelets allow you to hang this basket inside or outside the home. Measures 10-Inch at it's widest part, 5.75-Inch tall and 8.5-Inch at narrowest point across.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QCKWtBZtL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sun Bulb","source_asin":"B00Q3QPP50","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q3QPP50","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Q3QPP50","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":392489,"name":"Skytech FK-165-ESC Heat and Glow Fireplace Replacement Blower and Control Kit for GFK-4, Speed Controlled, Timer Activated","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":154.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XchJNhbGL.jpg","description":"The FK-165-ESC is a temperature controlled fireplace blower fan kit that is designed to circulate warm air through many hearth products in the industry, and provide variable speed control with a digital control box. Specifically, this is an exact replacement for the Heatilator GFK-4 fan kit. This unit operates on 120VAC, 60 Hz power, and increases the amount of air the fan will circulate through your room from the gas appliance. The increase in circulation will get up to 165 CFM (cubic feet per minute) and allow the room temperature to heat quicker, as well as maintain a consistent temperature-which also improves the energy efficiency of your appliance, saving you on energy costs. The blower fan will automatically turn on a few minutes after the gas heating appliance is ignited and off a few minutes after the appliance has been turned off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XchJNhbGL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SkyTech","source_asin":"B07754XG4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07754XG4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07754XG4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
