window.products.push({"id":392512,"name":"Juicer Machines, Aiheal New Generation Celery Slow Masticating Juicer Extractor Easy to Clean with Brush, Cold Press Juicer with Quiet Motor & Reverse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jm26+Q4kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍑【Do you want a healthy lifestyle】Drinking fruit juice is easier for the body to absorb than eating fruit directly. Slow masticating can perfectly separate juice and pulp,extracting higher-purity juice and preserving higher nutritional value. Our auger spins at 65-115 RPM , extracts up to 20% more juice and 30% more vitamins and minerals. Lower speed means no heat build-up and less oxidation.So we can drink the original flavor and absorb the most of the nutrition better with this juicer. 🍏【Why not choose a centrifugal juicer】The centrifugal juicer has high speed and high noise, which can damage the cell structure and cause nutrient loss. Our cold press juicer equipped with intelligent protection chips, making it stop automatically for every 20 minutes' operation. 150W DC motor- less than 60 decibels, small mouth design to put ingredients that prevent your hands getting injured. Just enjoying a quiet and safe environment and healthy life when making juice. 🍅【Why choose a slow juicer】Slow juicer extractor with 7 spiral masticating for maximum juice yield, minimal oxidation, reserved most nutrition.It can make various health foods for your family. No splashing, only a few seconds, you can drink a cup of juice with little pulp and foam. Rich vitamins can help maintain a good figure and enhance immunity. Especially when extracting fibrous fruits and vegetables such as celery, wheatgrass, which centrifugal juicer do not perform well. 🍇【What can be squeezed with a cold press juicer】Compared with manual juicers, aiheal juicer uses one-key start to extract soft and hard fruits and vegetables. Soft fruits such as tomato, watermelon, orange, grape, cucumber, etc. Hard vegetables such as celery, wheatgrass, apple, pear, carrot, etc. The detailed table is in our manual, also comes with a recipes containing a variety of juice. Very suitable for weight loss people, children, the elder. 🍉【What other great features does our Juicer have】Our Juicer machines features a safety lock design, helps you easy to assemble and disassemble in minutes. Juice Extractor Machines has reverse function to avoid stuck and helps you to clean. All detachable parts are made of high quality Food Grade BPA-free anti-oxidation materials, easy cleaning with a bonus brush or can be safely cleaned in your dishwasher. 🍋【What's included】 1*Slow Juicer, 1*Juice Tank, 1*Pulp tank, 2*Filters(1*Extra), 1*Cleaning Brush, 1*Wrench, 1* Instruction Manual, 1*Juicing Recipes Book. *DIY Healthy Juice At Home and Enhance Your Immunity. 🌈【Why choose Aiheal Juicer ?】We want you to feel safe and no worries with your purchase, the juicer comes with 10-year quality assurance of the motor and 2-year of nomal accessorry exchange, and lifelong technical support. Our package includes a delicious Recipe Guide for juicing beginners and juicing pros. please feel free to contact us if products have any problems. We specializes in providing buyers with high-quality kitchen appliance products and best user experiences.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jm26+Q4kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aiheal","source_asin":"B0BMVK5NYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMVK5NYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMVK5NYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
