window.products.push({"id":392584,"name":"Arspic Electric Gooseneck Kettle Pour Over Kettle for Coffee and Tea with 5 Temperature Control Presets, Stainless Steel Inner and lid with Leak-proof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nGBVWGlUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Arspic Gooseneck Electric Kettle When you pour water out of a regular kettle onto your coffee grounds, there's a chance for over-extraction. This can lead to a lousy cup of coffee. In order not to drown the beans, the water needs to be poured slowly, with complete precision, and at the perfect water temperature. The gooseneck spout and balance handle make it easier to pour coffee slowly and evenly extract it with variable temperatures. 5 Presets with Keep Warm Function This pour over kettle features 5 precise temperature presets. The accurate variable presets allow you to never again burn your coffee or tea leaves. It also has a Keep Warm function that you can choose to keep water at the same temperature for 60 minutes Turning Off The Ready Tone The electric kettle is designed with a ready tone that beeps 3 times when the water reached the preset temperature. Safe Tech and Auto Shut Off Designed with thermostat technology, auto shut-off after the water gets your desired temperature. Boil-dry safety feature where it turns off if it detects there is no water inside Unique Leak-Proof Design The spout is consistent and high strength laser welding, no need to worry leaking no matter how long you use it. The Pure Taste The coffee pour over kettle is made with 100% food-grade stainless steel in its housing, lid, and spout, with no Teflon or chemical linings, which keeps the perfect taste for your coffee and tea. Precise Pouring The precision pours spout is designed for the optimal pour-over flow rate. The counterbalanced handle helps keep your pour steady. Quick Heating The 1000 watts of power boil a full kettle in just 5 minutes, meaning you can enjoy a cup of  coffee in no time. An 1-hour keep warm function means hot water is always on standby.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nGBVWGlUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arspic","source_asin":"B09ND5JQK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ND5JQK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ND5JQK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
