window.products.push({"id":392655,"name":"CafePress Firetruck Unique Decorative 10\" Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QsxuEQ37L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These modern clocks measure approximately 9.5\" in diameter and feature a durable black plastic case and clear plastic lens. Each clock face design is professionally printed to show off the decorative or novelty art work. These battery operated (AA Battery Included) analog hanging clocks have an accurate quartz movement and make a classic addition to your home, kitchen, or office and are a fun gift for any occasion. With CafePress, your satisfaction is always our promise...buy with confidence, as we offer easy returns and exchanges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QsxuEQ37L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B00AFH4Y1E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AFH4Y1E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AFH4Y1E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":392656,"name":"Nieifi Corner Shower Caddy with Built-In Soap Holder with Hooks, Shower Organizer Shelf Rack Basket Storage, Rust Proof Stainless Steel Bathroom Shelv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eMvbhs3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our corner shower caddy with built-in soap holder is constructed rustproof stainless steel. [With Built-In Soap Holder]: Shower caddy corner that holds our soap, razor, wash cloth, scrub and shower bottles in one place features a built-in soap holder design. It is just the perfect size for a bar of soap. [Four Premium Hooks]: These four hooks are an elegant solution for our hanging items. They can easily be removable at your will, and double buckles on the back keep shower hanging items steady and upright. Four hooks are for hanging our brushes, shavers, loofa, our honey’s razor or bath sponges. [Adhesive with Strong Stickiness]: The adhesive is used as an alternative to screws, so just say goodbye to holes, marks, or sticky residue on your walls. Tool-free installation means no damage to your wall, just apply the adhesive on your shower wall, then hang your shower organizer. The adhesive is strong enough that you can pump your shampoo & conditioner in the caddy. [Rustproof SUS304 Stainless Steel]: The corner shower shelf is constructed of SUS304 stainless steel, easy to clean and rustproof. Plus, elegant look and sleek design will enhance your shower necessities. [Two Sizes]: There’s 2 sizes. One corner shower caddy is larger than the other, which works out perfectly. Because as a girl, if you use more products than your husband uses, he uses the smaller one and you use the larger one with full size.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eMvbhs3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nieifi","source_asin":"B093GTWLZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GTWLZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GTWLZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":392657,"name":"HPUK Decorative Throw Pillow Covers Set of 4 Couch Pillows Linen Cushion Cover for Couch Sofa Living Room, 18\"x18\" inches, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R1dsjgd+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Size: NO PILLOW INSERT. Set of 4, 17x17 inch pillow covers. 18x18 inch pillows are recommended to fill to make the cushion covers look fluffier Premium Material: Made of our top-grade polyester for a better visual experience and linen-hand feel. The fabric is not only more durable compared to traditional linen, but also free from fade, stain, and wrinkle, and 100% eco-friendly and harmless to skin Elegant Design: We use matching color invisible zipper for an elegant look, and the throw pillow covers are easy to insert and wash Widely Application: A must-have for room decoration, suitable for all kinds of occasions: couch, sofa, bed, office, living room, and bedroom and etc., also perfect to use as a gift Easy to Wash: Please use machine wash with cold water separately, gently cycle only, no bleach","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R1dsjgd+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HPUK","source_asin":"B08LMT8FL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LMT8FL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LMT8FL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":392658,"name":"Uncle Gifts Recipe for an Exceptional Uncle Birthday Gifts Paddle Shaped Bamboo Cutting Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mpGcN3U-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Uncle engraved cutting boards make unique uncle Father's Day gifts, uncle birthday gifts, or uncle thank you gifts. You have chosen a 13.5 inch long by 7 inch wide paddle shaped cutting board. Engraving color may vary slightly, as each piece of wood is unique. Made from 100% natural bamboo. Because every piece of wood is unique, the final engraved product may be slightly lighter or darker than pictured. This bamboo cutting board is pre-oiled for lasting durability. Bamboo is stronger, lighter, and more sustainable for the earth than traditional hardwoods. Display the engraved side and cut on your solid side. You get a beautiful piece of home décor and a usable cooking tool all in one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mpGcN3U-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThisWear","source_asin":"B07FB2871S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FB2871S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FB2871S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":392659,"name":"LG OTR 2.0 CF 1100-Watt Microwave, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31+dMZsiZUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Professional design, professional cooking: The LG LMHM2017 Microwave Ovens. The microwave was one of the greatest inventions of all time, providing a faster way to cook a meal or heat up a dish. But what if you just need to keep a dish warm without overcooking it? This Over the Range Microwave with Extended Vent comes with a warming lamp so you can keep food warm and ready to serve for up to 90-minute. Catch the Smoke: Over the Range microwaves have always been great at capturing the smoke from the back burners of your stovetop, but not the front burners. LG introduces the Extended Vent, which covers the entire cooking surface allowing for even greater ventilation. Warming Lamp: LG revolutionizes microwave cooking with the introduction of the first Warming Lamp. The warming lamp uses a radiant heating element to keep food warm, as opposed to microwaves or a hot bulb. Keep Quiet: With an Over the Range Microwave Oven, strong ventilation is key. That's why LG has created the Quiet Power vent, which does the job quietly, without interrupting your life. Sensor Cooking: Eliminate the guesswork in cooking. Humidity-sensing technology determines when food is cooked and automatically turns off the microwave to prevent the over- or under-cooking of meals. Monitor Design: Moving the controls to the bottom of this microwave oven gives it a unique look suitable for your design sensibilities. Look like a pro: This microwave will help you cook the perfect meal every time and match your design sensibilities. Our Professional Design features ease of accessibility and a pro-style, asymmetrical design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31+dMZsiZUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LG","source_asin":"B003JNE0WO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003JNE0WO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003JNE0WO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
