window.products.push({"id":392670,"name":"HOTKEN Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, Round Bowl Type Non Stick Air Fryer Liners, Grease Proof & Water Proof Parchment Paper for Baking, Roasting, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jk10wUdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT YOU WILL GET?: Comes with 100 pcs 6.3 inches air fryer disposable parchment paper liners, packed well with a clear plastic storage case, easy to be taken out to use and store. the heat is generated by air circulation from the pan's wall, and it will not affect the air circulation by using the air fryer disposable paper liners. NOTE that do not let the used parchment paper liner in the air fryer if it is still turned on; A great addition to your air fryer! HOTKEN AIR FRYER PAPER LINERS: The 6.3 inch 100 pcs air fryer paper liners are made out of premium quality parchment, coated with silicone oil, making them water proof, grease proof, non-stick, non leak, heat resistant and sturdy enough to withstand temperature up to 446℉, without affecting the taste of food you want to cook. The heightened edge 4.5cm can protect the side of air fryer and prevent food from sticking to the pan, allowing air to flow around the food to cook it well. EASY TO USE: The non-stick air fryer paper liners are designed with round bowl shape, not needing to be torn, folded, cut, nor bended, directly put into the air fryer after preheating; then adding heavy enough food onto the top to weigh it down; after desired cooking time, just pick it up taking it out of the air fryer, use it as a plate which saves you from using extra dishes and finally toss it away! PLEASE do not put the empty paper alone in the air fryer when preheating. MAKE CLEAN-UP A BREEZE: The air fryer disposable liners are used for catching grease, drippings, crumbs, not having to soak, scrub the air fryer basket/tray after each use, keeping it clean and food crispy, saving you time and effort cleaning the air fryer; extending the service time of your air fryer; no mess and no fuss! please remember to always use the paper liner with heavy enough food to weigh it down, or the hot air will blow it up to touch the heating element, causing it to get burned. MULTIPURPOSE USES: The air fryer parchment paper liners are suitable for roasting, frying, baking, air fryer, microwave, oven, frying pan, steamer, or serving foods; used for cooking, baking or reheating french fries, chicken wings, chicken thighs, onion rings, pizza, hamburger, roast chicken and so on; also applied to camping, home baking, BBQ, summer party, etc.. A must have in your kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jk10wUdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOTKEN","source_asin":"B09ZSMMD87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZSMMD87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZSMMD87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
