window.products.push({"id":392749,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Napoli Dinnerware Set (32-Piece)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417ZGTN24XL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Serve the whole family in style with the Pfaltzgraff Napoli Dinnerware Set. This 32-piece Napoli dinnerware set by Pfaltzgraff provides service for 8. This set includes 8 each of the following: and 11-1/2-inch dinner plate, a 8-1/2-inch salad plate, a 30-ounce soup/cereal bowl and 14 ounce mug. The durable stoneware is safe in the microwave, oven, freezer and dishwasher. The elegant designs and warm pink tones evoke the old-world romance of Italy's coast. This dinnerware set features a 5-year warranty against defects and pieces may be replaced individually. Amazon.com A warmly inviting setting for casual or formal meals, Napoli transports the old-world romance of Italy's coast to today's modern tables. The rich collection of images, including sprays of deep pink and violet blossoms, a meandering leafy vine, and delicate brushstroke trim with tiny blue dots, rearranges and varies on each sun-washed orange piece. Layered together, the effect is shapely and expressive to leave guests with a feeling of cozy serenity. This 32-piece set services a table full of diners with eight lovely place settings, each with an 11-1/2-inch dinner plate, an 8-1/2-inch salad plate, a 30-ounce soup/cereal bowl, and a 14-ounce mug. Add Napoli linen, glassware, serving pieces, and accessories for a home décor glowing with Mediterranean mood. Crafted of durable stoneware, the set is dishwasher-, oven-, freezer-, and microwave-safe. Pfaltzgraff offers a five-year warranty against defects and replaces pieces individually. --Kara Karll What's in the Box 8 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 11-1/2-inch dinner plate; 8-1/2-inch salad plate; 30-ounce soup/cereal bowl; 14-ounce mug. 32 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417ZGTN24XL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B000H6UQ24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000H6UQ24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000H6UQ24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
