window.products.push({"id":392757,"name":"KOBO Siam Poppy Scented Candle with Plantable Box (9 oz) | Plant The Box Collection, 100% Pure Soy Wax Candles | Hand-Poured in USA | Long Lasting 60 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lhdLGcmmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SIAM POPPY - Lusciously tropical and fragrant. In this aromatic blend, a sensual combination of black and red currants accents the poppies while a final, sweet citrus note provides the perfect finish. PLANT THE BOX COLLECTION - Don’t just light the candle – plant the box and literally watch it grow! This collection of pure soy candles comes in a plantable candle box, made of 100% post-consumer waste recycled packaging. The seeds are embedded in the compostable box so you can plant the whole box and grow the actual plant. A true cradle-to-cradle endeavor, these candles represent a new and unique approach, resulting in environmentally sustainable products and packaging. 60 HOUR LONG BURN TIME - With proper care, these candles have an impressive long-lasting burn time (see candle care instructions). Our soy wax candle is capable of burning for up to 60 hours without producing black soot or leaving behind a residue on surfaces. We use enviro-safe cotton wicks to provide a pure and clean flame. *Matches NOT included. CLEAN BURNING INGREDIENTS - KOBO Candles are made to provide a clean, safe burn with 100% pure ingredients. We use environmentally friendly materials that do not pollute the home or the environment. Our products are free of additives, dyes, phthalates, and oil-based petroleum products. Crafted using domestically grown soybeans and carefully selected, GMO-free, lead-free, and vegan ingredients. SOURCED FROM & HAND-POURED IN USA - We never use generic materials to create our scented candles. Each candle is made to specific standards in collaboration with the finest boutique fragrance houses in the U.S. To ensure the quality and integrity of our candles, each and every one is hand-poured in our family-run facility in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lhdLGcmmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOBO","source_asin":"B0BJZ8Q9JN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZ8Q9JN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZ8Q9JN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
