window.products.push({"id":392762,"name":"Touchless Automatic Soap Dispenser, 17oz / 500ml Touch-Free Soap Dispenser, w/Infrared Sensor Waterproof Base, Adjustable Switches for Restaurant Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sab2CoBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: 1) The silicone seal in the battery compartment protects 4 “AA” batteries (not included). Longer lasting than most other soap dispensers that have no sealed battery compartment. 2) Countertop placement for convenience and ease of operation. 3) Large refillable 17 oz. /500ml liquid soap container. 4) On/Off switch and soap dispenser volume control for complete control of the device. Use Instructions: 1. Install the battery correctly according to the instructions. (4 AA batteries required and need to be purchased separately). 2. Add the disinfectant according to the instructions. 3. Tap the power button, the indicator will be on. 4. Move your palm towards the IR detection area of the sprayer, the distance between your palm and the detection area should be kept within 1-2cm. Then the device will spray disinfectant. Warm Tips: 1. Don't put the product into water or wash the device with water. You can use paper or wet cloth to clean it. 2. Do not block the nozzle with hands or foreign matters, and do not lay down the device body, so as to avoid damage caused by liquid pouring into the machine body. 3.Please use handwashing fluid with a low concentration of alcohol. Granular soap is not recommended. 4. When the product runs out of power or will be not used for a long time, please take out the battery. Package Included: 1* Sanitizer Dispenser(No batteries included) 1* User Instruction Manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Sab2CoBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MANXIA","source_asin":"B08J2V2TSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J2V2TSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J2V2TSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
