window.products.push({"id":392795,"name":"Bamboo Ziplock Bag Organizer for Kitchen Drawer or Wall- Kitchen Food Storage Bags Container Organizer - Kitchen Plastic Bags Storage Compatible with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E0HjwCZ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% SOLID BAMBOO MATERIAL: This organizer is made from 100% natural material-bamboo with elegant looking, durable and long time lasting product and environment friendly. Very smooth surface and clean finish making it easily to get rid of any dirt or stains. ZIPLOCK BAG STORAGE ORGANIZER:Use this bamboo organizer box to make your drawer tidy and organized! This baggie organizer and storage is designed specifically for your gallon,quart,sandwish,and snack variety size plastic bags. EASY TO USE: The Baggie Organizer comes FULLY ASSEMBLED. You can hang on your wall with our hardware tool kit, put it in the kitchen drawer, or stand up freely on a kitchen countertop as well. DIFFERENT SIZE OF FOOD BAG ORGANIZER: The oversize of this ziploc bag storage organizer for drawer is 12.5*11.8*3.1 inches.Before you purchase it please measure your drawer size first to ensure drawer has about 3.1\" depth space to put food bags container. And all divide parts size is as follows: Quart bag organizer (8.2\"x2.7\"), Snack bag organizer (5.5\"x2.7\"), Sandwich bag organizer(8.2\"x2.7\"), Gallon bag organizer(11\"x 2.7\"), side Quart bag organizer (11\"x2.7\"). HOW TO CLEAN AND MAINTAIN THE ZIPLOC BAG CONTAINER: Just need wipe the bamboo drawer organizer with a water cloth (please keep it dry before you replace it). PLEASE NOTE: DON not put this ziplock bag holder organizer in dishwasher or soak it in water. Please to keep ventilated and dry. If you have any problem in the usage, please feel free to contact me. Gift For Organizers ：Our ziplock baggie organizer and delicate packaging is the perfect gift for family and friends for holidays like Thanksgiving and Christmas. It can help them to sort various of food bags, giving them a neat kitchen and bringing them a good and beautiful mood, and support 180 days no-excuse return and refund service, so you can use it with absolute confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E0HjwCZ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOHASOK","source_asin":"B0B5L48Q4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5L48Q4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5L48Q4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
