window.products.push({"id":392821,"name":"YOUBDM Neoprene Lunch Bags Thermal Insulated Lunch Tote Bag Reusable Washable Neoprene Picnic Bag for Women Men (Daisy flowers)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917ohcDF6mS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEOPRENE LUNCH BAG- This insulated lunch tote bag is made of thick neoprene material which is environmental. Stretchy material allows the soft lunch bag to expand to fit a variety of containers or foods. Neoprene is also widely used in wetsuit for keeping one's temperature, so it can keep food warm or cold for several hours. EXCELLENT DESIGN- This lunch kit with a flat bottom to make food containers and bottles sit upright, so you don't need to worry that the soup or drink will spill out. Soft grip handles always make your fingers comfortable, you can enjoy delicious food any time and any place. Funny dots prints, stripes prints and classic pure color will never go out of fashion. DURABLE & REUSABLE- Z-shaped stitching made the insulated bag extremely sturdy and durable. The premium zipper ensures you to open and close the lunch bag smoothly even it's stretched to maximum capacity. This durable lunch pack bag let you store the things you love in it safety enough on any occastion. MULTIPLE FUNCTIONS- This neoprene lunch bag can works well as meal prep bag, insulation bag, lunch pouch, picnic pouch, lunch bag for women, men. The lunch totes make your life more healthy, you can eat more nutritious salad, sandwiches, fruits instead of fast food, you can prepare delicious food for your family. WASHABLE & EASY TO CARRY- This multifunction lunch bag is easily washable, just rinse clean or machine wash and air dry. So you no need to worry about spills inside or outside the lunch totes anymore. It's also super lightweight and portable for you to take it out everyday. You can fold up or roll up the small lunch bag to take up less space when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917ohcDF6mS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOUBDM","source_asin":"B091BYRCRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091BYRCRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091BYRCRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":392822,"name":"Stair Basket, Staircase Basket Stair Bin Stair Step Basket, Canvas Fabric Basket for Stairs with Handles Collapsible Basket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xcZwQnUDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired of picking up scattered clothes and toys on your floor? As homeowners, we try our best to keep our space neat and well-sorted. Having a spotless living area and seeing our stuff in the right place is always a refreshing sight. But parents with full households know organization isn't always as easy as it seem. Clutter can creep up on you quickly, left behind by kids or pets that give no second thought to where things are supposed to go. Moms are often left to clean up the mess, which can be tiring and a waste of time. But you don't have to put yourself through that hassle anymore! Stop clutter in its tracks and keep your floors tidy with the Seizmo Inc Collapsible Stair Basket! Keep items that need to find their way back to bedrooms and kitchens in one place. Our spacious basket can hold 8lbs worth of clothes, jackets, shoes, chargers, magazines, and books. Don't have time to put your child's toys away before work? Just drop them into the hamper and go about your busy day. PS, that also means you'll be coming home to a clean house! Worried about whether the bins will fit your stairs? Don't sweat. This sturdy 14.x2x14.5\" container is designed to sit snugly on most steps, whether you have wooden floorboards or a carpeted staircase. Each basket comes in a sleek and elegant white color that looks good in any interior! You won't have to worry about it looking out of place, so you can still enjoy a stylish and cozy living space. When not in use, these baskets can be folded and tucked away. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons you'll love this basket: ✅ Fuss-free washing ✅ Collapsible design, easy to store ✅ Have an individual basket for everyone using name tags ✅ Doubles as a decoration when arranged with dried flowers Declutter your space the easy way. Add the Seizmo Inc Collapsible Stair Basket to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xcZwQnUDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Siezmo Inc.","source_asin":"B08FTG7GLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FTG7GLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FTG7GLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
