window.products.push({"id":392938,"name":"Mug Tree, Coffee Mug Holder, Coffee Cup Holder for Countertop, Counter Storage Stand for Large & Small Mugs Rack with 6 Leaf Shaped Hooks Wooden Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618iTTGlCfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality & Stability】The mug tree consists of a stylish elegant metal leaf-shaped hook design with a classic wooden base. Exquisite bronze paint finish makes it shiny, rust-proof and comfortable to touch. Cuboid thickened solid wood base can achieve a good balance, more stable, stronger bearing capacity and will not fall down due to the difference in weight on both sides. 【For Large Size Mugs & Non-Slip 】Coffee mug holder size：9.45\"(L)*3.95\"(W)*13.80\"(H). You can put up to 6 mugs, coffee cups or tea cups at a time, 2 of the 6 hooks are 6.3\" from the base, enough to hang any large size cup, which is very space-saving!!! The non-slip pad under the base not only stabilizes the cup holder, but also prevents scratches on the countertop. 【Practical & Beautiful】The coffee mug holder is not only a mug display rack, but also a beautiful decorative rack, you can use it as a display stand for small items such as jewelry, headphones, watches or keychains, etc. Perfect for cafe, dining room, kitchens, home and office counter. 【Perfect Gift】Unlike other cup racks, our coffee mug tree looks elegant and noble, simple and smooth lines inspire innovative modern style to the extreme. It turns your mug holder into artwork, fashionable coffee cup holder for countertop is eye-catching no matter where it is placed. It's a perfect gift for thanksgiving day, housewarming, Christmas, birthday and various festivals. 【Easy to Install & Care】Anyone can assemble the mug holder very easily, and it only takes 1 minute to assemble the 2 leaf holders with the wood base. When cleaning, please wipe gently with a damp cloth or dry with a towel as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618iTTGlCfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mbotnee","source_asin":"B09PRQXXTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-392938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PRQXXTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PRQXXTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
